### Implementation Details

**File Modified (Previously)**: `frontend/src/app/layout.tsx`

The Analytics component is correctly integrated into the root layout with proper placement:
- Imported from the Next.js-specific entry point
- Placed inside the `<body>` tag after other components
- Will automatically track page views and web vitals

### Official Documentation Compliance

The implementation matches the official Vercel Analytics quickstart guide (verified 2026-09-06):
- ✅ Correct package: `@vercel/analytics`
- ✅ Correct import path for Next.js: `@vercel/analytics/next`
- ✅ Correct placement: Inside root layout's `<body>` tag
